{"4302480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Calon Arang Nightmare of Revenge", "steam_appid": 4302480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the Indonesian legend of Calon Arang</strong>, this is a narrative-driven horror game focused on exploration, atmosphere, and psychological tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore cursed locations tied to an ancient dark ritual, uncover fragmented stories, and face supernatural threats that react to your presence. The horror is not only delivered through jump scares, but through environmental storytelling, traps, and relentless enemies that hunt you as the truth unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is developed by a <strong>solo developer</strong>, with a strong focus on mood, pacing, and immersive world design.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Exploration</strong><br>Uncover the story through environments, notes, and unsettling events rather than direct exposition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror Atmosphere</strong><br>Slow-burn tension mixed with sudden jump scares to keep players constantly on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps &amp; Enemy Encounters</strong><br>Dangerous traps and hostile entities designed to pressure players during exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legend-Based Horror</strong><br>Inspired by the dark myth of Calon Arang, blending folklore elements with original interpretation.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the Indonesian legend of Calon Arang</strong>, this is a narrative-driven horror game focused on exploration, atmosphere, and psychological tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore cursed locations tied to an ancient dark ritual, uncover fragmented stories, and face supernatural threats that react to your presence. The horror is not only delivered through jump scares, but through environmental storytelling, traps, and relentless enemies that hunt you as the truth unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is developed by a <strong>solo developer</strong>, with a strong focus on mood, pacing, and immersive world design.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Exploration</strong><br>Uncover the story through environments, notes, and unsettling events rather than direct exposition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror Atmosphere</strong><br>Slow-burn tension mixed with sudden jump scares to keep players constantly on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps &amp; Enemy Encounters</strong><br>Dangerous traps and hostile entities designed to pressure players during exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legend-Based Horror</strong><br>Inspired by the dark myth of Calon Arang, blending folklore elements with original interpretation.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A narrative-driven horror game inspired by the Indonesian legend of Calon Arang. Explore cursed locations, uncover dark rituals, and survive psychological terror filled with jump scares, traps, and relentless enemies.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302480/ed34e912f505de140295711f09735074b5f2655f/header.jpg?t=1769429865", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302480/8522de008c379dc47f55254791d17ee8a0daa6ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769429865", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302480/8522de008c379dc47f55254791d17ee8a0daa6ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769429